---
global:
  domain: joinedcontext.test
  profile: development
  instanceSlug: local
  ingress:
    # The k3d cluster of the deployment-variants lane installs ingress-nginx, so this
    # environment is published behind a controller. This flag gates exactly one thing in the
    # repository: the `apisix-edge` Certificate that fills the Secret the APISIX Ingress
    # terminates on. The Ingress renders either way, so leaving it off cost no error at all —
    # ingress-nginx just served its fake certificate, and only a client that verifies the
    # chain ever noticed (T-0350).
    enabled: true
